# PR Review Checklist

- [ ] Issue / HU referenced
- [ ] Acceptance criteria covered
- [ ] Multi-tenant isolation verified
- [ ] Input validation present
- [ ] Tests or QA justification
- [ ] No secrets / `.env` files
- [ ] Lint/build OK
- [ ] UI matches prototype (if UI change)
- [ ] No dead code or blocking TODOs without an issue
